trait-luam-ipc-corrosion-name = Corrosion Vulnerability
trait-luam-ipc-corrosion-desc = Your chassis is poorly sealed against moisture and acid. Caustic damage is 50% higher, and water shorts your circuits: 5 shock damage for every 5 units.
trait-luam-ipc-unstable-wiring-name = Unstable Wiring
trait-luam-ipc-unstable-wiring-desc = Shock damage or a stamina crit shorts your wiring: you are stunned for 2.5 seconds, lose 25% of your battery and let out a discharge that deals 15 shock damage to you and everyone within 2.5 tiles. At most once every 30 seconds.
trait-luam-ipc-power-hungry-name = Power Hungry
trait-luam-ipc-power-hungry-desc = Your systems eat power: you use 15 charge per second, more than even a microreactor cell can recharge.
trait-luam-ipc-fragile-chassis-name = Fragile Chassis
trait-luam-ipc-fragile-chassis-desc = Your chassis is made of cheap alloys. Your health is 75 lower.
trait-luam-ipc-complex-design-name = Complex Design
trait-luam-ipc-complex-design-desc = You are hard to fix. Healing from any source, from nanites to welding, is half as strong, and welding repairs take twice as long.
trait-luam-ipc-ancient-servos-name = Ancient Servos
trait-luam-ipc-ancient-servos-desc = Your servos are long outdated. Your movement speed is 10% lower.

unstable-wiring-short = The wiring sparks and shorts out!
